an begin="00:38.320" end="00:38.410">the </span><span begin="00:38.410" end="00:40.540">table</span><span begin="00:40.540" end="00:40.570">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.570" end="00:45.340"><span begin="00:40.570" end="00:40.900">Do </span><span begin="00:40.900" end="00:41.050">I </span><span begin="00:41.050" end="00:41.350">sit </span><span begin="00:41.350" end="00:41.650">this </span><span begin="00:41.650" end="00:41.860">one </span><span begin="00:41.860" end="00:42.130">out </span><span begin="00:42.130" end="00:42.250">and </span><span begin="00:42.250" end="00:42.520">wait </span><span begin="00:42.520" end="00:42.790">for </span><span begin="00:42.790" end="00:42.910">the </span><span begin="00:42.910" end="00:43.450">next </span><span begin="00:43.450" end="00:44.980">life</span><span begin="00:44.980" end="00:45.340">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.340" end="00:49.450"><span begin="00:45.340" end="00:45.580">Am </span><span begin="00:45.580" end="00:45.760">I </span><span begin="00:45.760" end="00:46.000">too </span><span begin="00:46.000" end="00:46.390">cold</span><span begin="00:46.390" end="00:46.390">? </span><span begin="00:46.390" end="00:46.570">Am </span><span begin="00:46.570" end="00:46.780">I </span><span begin="00:46.780" end="00:47.110">not </span><span begin="00:47.110" end="00:49.420">nice</span><span begin="00:49.420" end="00:49.450">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.450" end="00:52.060"><span begin="00:49.450" end="00:49.720">Might </span><span begin="00:49.720" end="00:49.930">not </span><span begin="00:49.930" end="00:50.080">be </span><span begin="00:50.080" end="00:50.440">quite </span><span begin="00:50.440" end="00:50.710">yet </span><span begin="00:50.710" end="00:51.280">healed </span><span begin="00:51.280" end="00:51.370">or </span><span begin="00:51.370" end="00:52.060">ready</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.330" end="00:54.430"><span begin="00:52.330" end="00:52.750">Should </span><