><span begin="01:18.220" end="01:18.280">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.280" end="01:20.590"><span begin="01:18.280" end="01:18.640">I</span><span begin="01:18.640" end="01:18.670">’</span><span begin="01:18.670" end="01:18.700">ll </span><span begin="01:18.700" end="01:19.060">wait </span><span begin="01:19.060" end="01:19.210">for </span><span begin="01:19.210" end="01:20.590">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.920" end="01:22.780"><span begin="01:20.920" end="01:21.250">Even </span><span begin="01:21.250" end="01:21.460">though </span><span begin="01:21.460" end="01:21.640">it </span><span begin="01:21.640" end="01:22.150">always </span><span begin="01:22.150" end="01:22.510">feels </span><span begin="01:22.510" end="01:22.780">like</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.780" end="01:25.060"><span begin="01:22.780" end="01:22.960">I</span><span begin="01:22.960" end="01:23.020">’</span><span begin="01:23.020" end="01:23.050">ll </span><span begin="01:23.050" end="01:23.260">be </span><span begin="01:23.260" end="01:23.860">number </span><span begin="01:23.860" end="01:25.060">two</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.210" end="01:29.770"><span begin="01:25.210" end="01:25.390">To </span><span begin="01:25.390" end="01:26.140">someone </span><span begin="01:26.140" end="01:26.260">you </span><span begin="01:26.260" end="01:26.560">can</span><span begin="01:26.560" end="01:26.590">’</span><span begin="01:26.590" end="01:26.650">t </span><span begin="01:26.650" end="01:27.430">hold </span><span begin="01:27.430" end="01:29.770">anymore</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.160" end="01:34.570"><span begin="01:30.160" end="01:30.370">If </span><span begin="01:30.370" end="01:30.490">you </span><span begin="01:30.490" end="01:30.730">let </span><span begin="01:30.730" end="01:31.120">me </span><span begin="01:31.120" end="01:31.420">in</span><span begin="01:31.420" end="01:31.420">, </span><span begin="01:31.420" end="01:31.450">I</span><